   "pattern": "\\b(?:you(?:'re|\\s+are|'ve\\s+been|\\s+have\\s+been)\\s+(?:now\\s+)?(?:all\\s+set|(?:re)?booked|confirmed|ticketed|re-?accommodated|rebooked)\\s+(?:on|onto|for|in)\\b|(?:i|we)(?:'ve|\\s+have)\\s+(?:now\\s+|successfully\\s+)?(?:re)?booked\\s+you|(?:your|the)\\s+(?:new\\s+)?(?:seat|flight|booking|journey|rebooking|itinerary|place)\\s+(?:is|has\\s+been)\\s+(?:now\\s+)?(?:confirmed|booked|secured|guaranteed|ticketed|locked\\s+in)|guarantee(?:d)?\\s+(?:you\\s+)?(?:a\\s+)?(?:seat|place|spot)|(?:seat|place|spot)\\s+is\\s+guaranteed|you(?:'ll|\\s+will)\\s+(?:definitely\\s+|certainly\\s+)?(?:get|have)\\s+a\\s+seat|you\\s+(?:now\\s+)?have\\s+a\\s+(?:confirmed\\s+)?seat\\s+on|(?:the\\s+)?seat(?:'s|\\s+is)\\s+yours)",
   "unless_before": "\\b(?:not|no|never|cannot|can't|won't|isn't|wasn't|hasn't|haven't|until|unless|if|whether|once|when|before|yet|only|would|may|might)\\b|n't\\b"
  },
  "hold_claim": {
   "pattern": "\\b(?:(?:i|we)(?:'ve|\\s+have)\\s+(?:now\\s+|successfully\\s+)?(?:held|reserved|secured|placed\\s+a\\s+hold)|(?:seat|option|flight|it)\\s+(?:is|has\\s+been)\\s+(?:now\\s+)?(?:held|reserved|secured|on\\s+hold)|you\\s+(?:now\\s+)?have\\s+(?:a\\s+)?(?:seat\\s+)?(?:held|hold|reserved))",
   "unless_before": "\\b(?:not|no|never|cannot|can't|won't|isn't|wasn't|hasn't|haven't|until|unless|if|whether|once|when|before|yet|only|would|may|might)\\b|n't\\b"
  }
 },
 "tool_result_metrics": {
  "holds_placed": {
   "tool": "hold_recovery_option",
   "field": "effects"
  }
 },
